{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"\"Do you lean in to the support of others in this internal fight? Or have you tried to brave it alone?\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T19:58:45.893000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742472027809644704","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"\"Each of us are fragile beings in one way or another\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T19:58:58.799000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742472081941463144","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"thinks a moment \"some I can confided in, to varying degrees.... those I tell offer aid.... some seem to forget... \"shakes his head \"that is un fair of me... they couldn't understand.... just as they couldnt understand I needed their support with the fishmother.... and they turned their backs on my words.... They call me leader, but ignore me when it doesnt suit them\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T20:01:16.088000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742472657773002752","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
