{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"(When he was talking about the fishmother incident, a spike of feeling betrayed shows)","created_at":"2020-08-10T20:06:11.325000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-10T20:07:20.112000Z","id":"742473896086994966","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"\"You chose to stay with the colony instead of joining Fishmother out of good faith, no? And when you needed the support of everyone back, the different agendas did not unify. With the rising waters I'd imagine that another encounter is soon to happen. Once the water reaches the lake of woes, there would be a chance to avoid conflict between the two tribes. To exist in a neutral setting where peace could be resolved?\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T20:08:19.592000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742474434077524081","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"\"I did choose to stay with the colony.... but that was one of the most difficult decisions I have made.... and this colony has no unity as i see it.... we spend so much time fragmented.... it is 'like pulling teeth' to get them to do anything that needs done....\"  thinks a moment \"if it floods to that point.... how many of our people will drown here?  shouldnt we investigate the lake before then... see if a solution can be found before you all drown.... or get information.... people would rather argue about statues.... than what needs done.... I wont die if this island sinks.... but I have no desire to lose another School.\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T20:13:47.086000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742475807687049337","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"(note for DM, gil believes the flooding, which started after the chinn visit, is our incentive to do the favor we were asked to do)","created_at":"2020-08-10T20:19:06.719000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742477148325019830","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"\"I agree. Just last week we had difficulty agreeing to dispatch an enemy that only meant us harm. However, from what I 'Ave heard, you helped mediate the both sides of conflict to determine the best path. That is the true burden of just leadership. The people have their liberties and can trust in choice, but that those they elected can help them the most to make good decisions. You did something that the crown and aristocracy hates... You chose a democratic solution that serves the people, and that allows you to not bare le burden alone. I believe that within two days time you can gather those you need to make it back there. I offer my support should you require\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T20:20:43.535000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742477554400755765","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"He smiles","created_at":"2020-08-10T20:20:46.456000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742477566652317716","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"\"Thank you.... as for the other matter... I explained to cato.... I am neither protector, nor messiah to save them.... All i have is the ability to allow those that need healing to heal.... and the wisdom to let people that need to pick their battlefield to do so.... I am the one that people defend.\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T20:24:13.596000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742478435460448306","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"\"as you said he is spirited.... but I do not see the qualities he mentioned within myself\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T20:24:58.134000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742478622266228816","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"\"Oh no no, one does not have to be a soldier to be one of us. We do not exist for the purpose of keeping a sword and shield over the world. We strive for serving others and giving the most good upon the world\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T20:26:13.793000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742478939603337328","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"sips the tea some more, listening","created_at":"2020-08-10T20:26:58.102000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742479125448491031","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"\"A week and a half ago, I was not much use to anyone at all. And after washing up unconscious, you had saved me from drowning. You acted in service of another, you did not know, but because it was the right thing to do\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T20:27:42.362000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742479311088517170","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"\"That is our core. With the 15, consumed or corrupted by The Hunger it left famine and decay, where our goddesses of nature protected. Where the dawn brought forth chirping birds and radiant shine, now brings overcast skies that rain down tears of mourning. Our service to others is a divine oath that preserves and grows the divine spark inside of us. Our oath is a bond that let's us have a part in maintaining and one day helping fix the suffering others go through in the old world\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T20:30:45.713000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742480080118480996","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"\"You are aware of the artifacts we have collected over the past few weeks. They help us grow that bond. A remnant of divinity that we wish restored to the world\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T20:31:22.037000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742480232472117389","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"nods to Florian","created_at":"2020-08-10T20:31:41.534000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742480314248593560","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"\"In our oath, violence is never the default answer. Honor, duty, faith, fairness, aiding the innocent, mercy. These make up the brunt of our cause\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T20:33:05.113000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742480664804196492","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"\"Our end goals seem to align.... our philosophies similar.... I will have to think on these words..... Your view is from within... and no one ever thinks themselves a villian... but there is always someone that will see you a villian...\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T20:34:46.836000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742481091461513368","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"\"Indeed, it can be easy to lose sight of who we are in those cases if we let the ends overturn the means. Everyone deserves their choice to believe in what they desire\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T20:36:10.010000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742481440318554202","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"He smiles and finishes his tea","created_at":"2020-08-10T20:36:16.263000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742481466545537145","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
