{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"She nods \"My wings, what do you want to know.\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T21:38:29.908000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742497126587695205","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"\"How did you get them?\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T21:39:43.590000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742497435632533554","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"\"They didn't always appear the way they do now. Before they where white and let off a bright light. But something changed when I began to worship the Raven Queen. I always respected the Gods, its in my devine nature to do so being Aasimar. However something drew me to her, the more I began to worship and pray to her the dimmer that light became. Then the shipwreck happened. After all of those deaths... I prayed to the Raven Queen more then ever, I became fully devoted to her. That's when I felt the difference. My wings turned black and my attacks drained life instead of burning with holy power.\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T21:46:09.533000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742499054394671196","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"\"I'm not sure who, but I think one of the Gods disowned me and being in their Celestial bloodline when I began to worship her.\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T21:47:01.409000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-10T21:47:57.693000Z","id":"742499271978385478","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"\"Hmmm do you miss it. Them being white. Or have you accepted it.\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T21:48:03.708000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742499533279330464","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"\"If I knew who I angered than I would try to make amends. However, I don't think I would turn away from the Raven Queen so easily.\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T21:49:32.541000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742499905871937546","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
